  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Slice the double rise bread into 1 inch thick slices and toast until lightly browned",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the saeujeot shrimp paste, olive oil, onion, garlic, cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper",
    "Add the shrimp to the bowl and toss to coat with the shrimp paste mixture",
    "Transfer the shrimp mixture to a slate tile vessel",
    "Bake the shrimp in the preheated oven for 12 minutes, or until pink and cooked through",
    "Serve the shrimp with the toasted double rise bread and garnish with chopped fresh parsley"
  ],
